<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-2806] Newly added cells not showing up without page refresh</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2806</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;We deployed a new Zeppelin build and noticed that we have to refresh notebook pages to get newly added cells to show up. Note that it works fine when adding a cell at the very top (before and after the first cell thus). It doesn&apos;t work after a cell already ran before the update.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Adding a cell also throws js error : &lt;/p&gt;

